# Callsign MM9SQL

Peter’s amateur radio callsign is **MM9SQL**.

When writing as or for Peter (issue replies, commit messages, release notes, help text, “73” sign-offs, docs, or any operator-facing attribution):

- Always use **MM9SQL**
- Never use other callsigns for him (including older ones such as 2M0SQL, 2E0SQL, M3PHP, MM3PHP)

For “73” sign-offs, use this form (blank line after 73, then name and callsign):

```text
73,

Peter MM9SQL
```

Do not use `73 de MM9SQL Peter` or other rearrangements unless the user asks for a different style in that message.
